    "body": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#182c25\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A cozy community for Pok\u00e9mon collectors, daily gut check-ins, and wonderfully offbeat conversations.\"><title>A little weird. A lot of good company. \u00b7 Pok\u00e9 &amp; Poop</title><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/assets/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/style.css\"><script src=\"/assets/app.js\" defer></script></head>\n<body><a href=\"#main\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to content</a><div class=\"app-shell\">\n<aside class=\"sidebar\" id=\"navigation\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/?page=home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><span></span></span><span>Pok\u00e9 &amp; Poop<small>A VERY REGULAR COMMUNITY</small></span></a><div class=\"sidebar-label\">YOUR LITTLE CORNER</div><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n<a href=\"/?page=forum\" class=\"nav-link active\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>Community board</span><span class=\"nav-dot\"></span></a>\n<a href=\"/?page=collection\" class=\"nav-link \"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"3\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 7v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10M11 8h5M11 12h5\"/></svg><span>My collection</span></a>\n<a href=\"/?page=health\" class=\"nav-link \"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1.1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z\"/></svg><span>My gut check</span></a>\n<a href=\"/?page=members\" class=\"nav-link \"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2\"/></svg><span>The community</span></a>\n</nav><div class=\"sidebar-card\"><span class=\"orbit\">\u2726</span><p>Rare finds.<br>Regular friends.</p><small>A place for your collection.<br>And a little oversharing.</small><div class=\"little-ball\"></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><span class=\"online-dot\"></span> A good place to be yourself<div class=\"sidebar-footnote\">Made for collectors. And humans.</div></div></aside>\n<div class=\"main-shell\"><header class=\"topbar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-button menu-button\" data-menu aria-controls=\"navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\">\u2630</button><div class=\"breadcrumb\">THE CLUBHOUSE <span>/</span> <strong>A little weird. A lot of good company.</strong></div><div class=\"topbar-actions\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/?page=login\">Log in</a><a class=\"button primary small-button\" href=\"/?page=register\">Join the club <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></header>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"welcome-line\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">COLLECT. CONNECT. CHECK IN.</span><span class=\"season-note\">A different kind of trainer club <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5L12 3Z\"/></svg></span></div>\n<section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"hero-copy\"><span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"online-dot\"></span> YOUR PEOPLE ARE HERE</span><h1>Great pulls.<br>Good guts.<br><em>Even better company.</em></h1><p>Show off your Pok\u00e9mon. Check in with yourself.<br>Find your people in the most delightfully<br class=\"desktop-break\"> unexpected corner of the internet.</p><a class=\"button butter\" href=\"/?page=register\">Find your place <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><div class=\"hero-caption\"><span>\u2726</span> All collectors welcome. Oversharing encouraged.</div></div><div class=\"hero-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"art-spark spark-one\">\u2726</span><span class=\"art-spark spark-two\">\u2727</span><div class=\"trading-card card-back\"><div class=\"card-orbit\"></div><span class=\"card-back-star\">\u2726</span></div><div class=\"trading-card card-front\"><div class=\"card-topline\"><b>THE GOOD STUFF</b><span>\u2605 120</span></div><div class=\"card-art\"><div class=\"pokeball-art\"><span></span></div><span class=\"card-twinkle\">\u2726</span><span class=\"card-twinkle second\">\u2727</span><span class=\"card-grass\"></span></div><div class=\"card-bottom\"><span>Collector energy</span><b>\u221e</b></div><div class=\"card-lines\"></div><div class=\"card-lines short\"></div><small>RARE FRIENDSHIPS \u00b7 EVERY DAY</small></div><div class=\"floating-badge\"><span>\ud83d\udc51</span><div>POOP KING<small>Royalty comes naturally.</small></div></div><div class=\"tiny-sticker\">100%<br><b>your kind<br>of weird.</b></div></div></section>\n<div class=\"feature-strip\"><div><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"3\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 7v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10M11 8h5M11 12h5\"/></svg><span><strong>Your collection, all together</strong><small>Every pull has a story.</small></span></div><div><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1.1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z\"/></svg><span><strong>A little daily gut check</strong><small>Your notes. Your pace. Your privacy.</small></span></div><div><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8v.5Z\"/></svg><span><strong>Very good conversations</strong><small>Find people who get it.</small></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"content-grid\"><section><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>A peek inside the clubhouse <span class=\"count-chip\">PREVIEW</span></h2><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/?page=register\">Come on in <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"preview-note\">Illustrative conversations. Join to see the member-only board.</div>\n<article class=\"post-card preview-post\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"avatar lilac \">L</span><div><strong>leafy_trainer</strong><span class=\"meta-sub\">Example member</span></div><span class=\"badge gold\">\u2726 Golden gut</span><span class=\"category-label pokemon\">Pok\u00e9mon collections</span></div><a class=\"post-title\" href=\"/?page=register\">That one card you\u2019ll never trade. I\u2019ll go first.</a><p>It\u2019s not the rarest in my binder, but my first Bulbasaur is staying with me forever. What\u2019s yours?</p><div class=\"post-footer\"><span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8v.5Z\"/></svg> A collection conversation</span><a href=\"/?page=register\" class=\"text-link\">Join the conversation <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></article>\n<article class=\"post-card preview-post\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"avatar peach \">P</span><div><strong>Peeeter</strong><span class=\"meta-sub\">Example member</span></div><span class=\"badge king\">\ud83d\udc51 Poop King</span><span class=\"category-label gut\">Gut check</span></div><a class=\"post-title\" href=\"/?page=register\">A new king has entered the chat \ud83d\udc51</a><p>Five trips. One crown. My Pok\u00e9mon collection has some competition for my proudest achievement.</p><div class=\"post-footer\"><span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8v.5Z\"/></svg> A little community lore</span><a href=\"/?page=register\" class=\"text-link\">Join the conversation <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></article>\n<article class=\"post-card preview-post\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"avatar blue \">T</span><div><strong>tiny_adventures</strong><span class=\"meta-sub\">Example member</span></div><span class=\"badge neutral\">\ud83c\udf3f Taking it easy</span><span class=\"category-label general\">General chat</span></div><a class=\"post-title\" href=\"/?page=register\">A tiny win thread. Pok\u00e9mon-related or otherwise.</a><p>Finished organizing a whole binder today. Sometimes the small things are the good things.</p><div class=\"post-footer\"><span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8v.5Z\"/></svg> Good company, always</span><a href=\"/?page=register\" class=\"text-link\">Join the conversation <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></article>\n</section><aside class=\"right-rail\"><section class=\"panel badge-guide\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h3>Wear your weird.</h3><span>\u2726</span></div><p>A little badge. A little personality.</p><div class=\"badge-row\"><span class=\"badge-symbol golden\">\u2726</span><div><strong>Golden gut</strong><small>Feeling great? Let it shine.</small></div></div><div class=\"badge-row\"><span class=\"badge-symbol brown\">\ud83d\udca9</span><div><strong>Rough day</strong><small>Not every day is a gold day.</small></div></div><div class=\"badge-row\"><span class=\"badge-symbol purple\">\ud83d\udc51</span><div><strong>Poop King</strong><small>5+ trips in your latest check-in.</small></div></div><div class=\"fine-print\">Just for fun, based on your latest check-in. Badges aren\u2019t medical assessments. Sharing is always optional.</div></section>\n<div class=\"note-card\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">OUR KIND OF COMMUNITY</span><h3>A little niche.<br>A lot of heart.</h3><p>Be kind. Celebrate the small wins. Keep the photos Pok\u00e9mon-related, and the gut talk respectful.</p><span class=\"note-signoff\">You\u2019ll fit right in. \u2661</span></div></aside></div>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><span>Pok\u00e9 &amp; Poop <span class=\"footer-star\">\u2726</span> Good pulls. Good gut. Great company.</span><span>An unofficial fan community.</span></footer></main></div></div></body></html>\n"
